'''Emerson Park''' is an electoral ward in the [[London Borough of Havering]]. The ward has existed since the creation of the borough on 1 April 1965 and was first used in the [[1964 London local elections|1964 elections]]. It returns councillors to [[Havering London Borough Council]].

==Havering council elections since 2022==
There was a revision of ward boundaries in Havering in 2022.

